  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole-organism adult, strongly forward-curving nasal horn and paired long frill spikes. [\"Body proportion and skin/colour/keratin outline inferred; no claim of a single complete articulated holotype body.\", \"Living soft tissue covers cranial bone openings. Fossil breakage/assembly gaps must not become body holes.\", \"Skull references compare different ontogenetic stages; adult phenotype only.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 6.0, \"basis\": \"NHM taxon-level6m estimate, NOT measured complete holotype skeleton.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole-organism adult, strongly forward-curving nasal horn and paired long frill spikes. [\"Body proportion and skin/colour/keratin outline inferred; no claim of a single complete articulated holotype body.\", \"Living soft tissue covers cranial bone openings. Fossil breakage/assembly gaps must not become body holes.\", \"Skull references compare different ontogenetic stages; adult phenotype only.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 6.0, \"basis\": \"NHM taxon-level6m estimate, NOT measured complete holotype skeleton.\"}"
